The error in the code is due to the incorrect initialization of `current_length` to 0. This causes the function to undercount the length of the longest increasing sequence by 1 in cases where the sequence is correctly identified. The fix is to initialize `current_length` to 1 to correctly capture the starting point of the sequence.

```json
[
    {
        "command_name": "end"
    }
]
```
